### list notes

GET http://localhost:8000/notes/ HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

### create note

POST http://localhost:8000/notes/ HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "title": "Third Note",
    "content": "lorem ipsum 3"
}

### partial update note

PATCH http://localhost:8000/notes/2/ HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "content": "lorem ipsum 00001"
}

### delete note

DELETE http://localhost:8000/notes/1/ HTTP/1.1
